        "TileImage": "$($repository 293579a3-b1d9-415a-ad3f-9f876892d9b1).Image",
        "Description": "Unbarian...\rKnown Providence Commando and Mercenary Orson Mills has been spotted in New Zealand.\rMills is said to have returned to Hawkes Bay from a so called &quot;Snob Fest&quot; party in order to host a &quot;Firework Funeral&quot; for his PTSD ridden partner Alma Reynard&apos;s emotional support dog &quot;Maximillian&quot;.\rYour mission is to kill:\r- Orson using an electrecution accident.\r- Alma with an Assault Rifle.\r- Dog-Sitter Gerard Mann with a Thrown Shuriken.\r- Cremate Max&apos;s Corpse using the Fireworks Truck.\r\rGood Luck",
        "GameVersion": "8.24.0.0",
